content:
Here's a **self-contained HTML file** (single-page app) that mimics **Linear’s modern UI and interactions**, including the gradient background, blur effects, and neumorphic cards. It uses **pure Tailwind CSS + custom CSS** for animations and effects.  

---

### 🔗 Key Features:
1. **Glassmorphism + Neumorphic Cards**  
2. **Spline or Lottie (optional) animations**  
3. **Animated Gradients (Hero Section)**  
4. **Footer with Sparkle, Aurora, or Geometric graphics**  
5. **Responsive & Dark Mode Ready**

---

### 🚀 Full HTML Code:
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>M2 - Linear-like UI</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tailwindcss@3.0.0/dist/tailwind.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0B1120;
            --primary: #6366F1;
            --accent: #22D3EE;
        }
        html {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background: radial-gradient(at 70% 30%, #0A1221 0%, #111827 100%);
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: white;
        }
        .glass-card {
            backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
            background-color: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            padding: 28px;
        }
        .neo-card {
            box-shadow: inset 3px 3px 6px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08),
                        inset -3px -3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4),
                        3px 3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        .gradient-text {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #6366F1, #22D3EE);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            color: transparent;
        }
        /* Hero Gradient */
        .hero-gradient {
            background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #1f2937 0%, #0B1120 100%);
        }
        @keyframes gradient-move {
            0% {
                background-position: 0% 50%;
            }
            50% {
                background-position: 100% 50%;
            }
            100% {
                background-position: 0% 50%;
            }
        }
        .animated-gradient {
            animation: gradient-move 10s linear infinite;
            background-size: 200% 200%;
        }
        @keyframes fadeUp {
            0% {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }
            100% {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }
        .fade-up {
            animation: fadeUp 0.7s ease-out forwards;
        }
        /* Marquee */
        @keyframes marquee {
            0% { transform: translateX(0); }
            100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }
        }
        .marquee-content {
            animation: marquee 15s linear infinite;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="overflow-x-hidden text-gray-100">

<!-- HEADER -->
<header class="sticky top-0 z-10 bg-[#0B1120]/70 backdrop-blur-sm py-4">
    <nav class="container mx-auto flex justify-between items-center px-4">
        <div class="text-xl font-semibold gradient-text">M2</div>
        <div class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-4">
            <a href="#features" class="hover:text-gray-300 transition">Features</a>
            <a href="#testimonials" class="hover:text-gray-300 transition">Testimonials</a>
            <a href="#pricing" class="hover:text-gray-300 transition">Pricing</a>
            <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-gray-300 transition">FAQ</a>
            <button class="bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition">Sign Up</button>
        </div>
        <!-- Mobile Menu -->
        <div class="md:hidden">
            <button id="menu-button" class="text-gray-300 focus:outline-none">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </nav>
    <div id="mobile-menu" class="md:hidden hidden bg-[#0B1120] px-4 pt-2 pb-4">
        <a href="#features" class="block hover:text-gray-300">Features</a>
        <a href="#testimonials" class="block hover:text-gray-300">Testimonials</a>
        <a href="#pricing" class="block hover:text-gray-300">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#faq" class="block hover:text-gray-300">FAQ</a>
    </div>
</header>

<!-- HERO SECTION -->
<section class="hero-gradient px-4 pt-16 pb-24 text-center animated-gradient">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold fade-up leading-tight">
        Build Your Ideas <span class="gradient-text">Faster.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto fade-up">
        A next-gen platform with a Linear-like interface. Drag & drop, collaborate, and ship products at light speed with our open-source framework.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 fade-up">
        <button class="bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-white transition">Get Started</button>
        <button class="ml-4 border border-indigo-500 text-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-500/10 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition">Learn More</button>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURES SECTION -->
